      "writtenOn": "2014-01-15T16:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the right place to do the registration, but this need a large comment block explaining why it is here.  Also the there is no reason to use the prefix \u0027__\u0027 this is a private function isolated to the \"wrapped\" method.\n\nSo, suggest fixing the \"name\" of the function and make sure this is well documented here in-line so it is clear why it\u0027s implemented here.",
