      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-01-15T19:00:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree with Morgan. The main use case for notifications subscription is to update the corresponding data when the related data has changed as we are further decoupling relational data to support other backends (i.e. non-relational data stores). Providers are responsible for data manipulation so this is the right place for it.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAUH//ReU\u003d",
      "revId": "1c656974f8f59b0193780ac8f5365e873aa30b50",
